<mjml lang="en-AU">
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>You're approved — welcome to Home Insulation Victoria</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>Sample Insulation Co can now take VEU ceiling insulation jobs. Set your password to get started.</mj-preview>
    <mj-include path="./partials/head.mjml" />
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body>
    <mj-wrapper css-class="card">
      <mj-include path="./partials/header.mjml" />
      <mj-section>
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text mj-class="hi">Welcome aboard, Sam.</mj-text>
          <mj-text mj-class="h1" css-class="email-heading" padding="4px 12px 10px">You're approved!</mj-text>
          <mj-text>Sample Insulation Co can now take VEU ceiling insulation jobs through Home Insulation Victoria. Here's what you get:</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>
      <mj-section>
        <mj-column mj-class="panel-card">
          <mj-table padding="18px 18px 6px">
            <tr><td width="32" valign="top" style="padding:2px 0 14px;"><span class="tick">&#10003;</span></td><td style="padding:0 0 14px;">Jobs sent to you, plus add your own customers</td></tr>
            <tr><td width="32" valign="top" style="padding:2px 0 14px;"><span class="tick">&#10003;</span></td><td style="padding:0 0 14px;">Your price, never marked up. We only add our $349 AP fee</td></tr>
            <tr><td width="32" valign="top" style="padding:2px 0 12px;"><span class="tick">&#10003;</span></td><td style="padding:0 0 12px;">Quotes, electrician, compliance and rebate paperwork handled by us</td></tr>
          </mj-table>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>
      <mj-section>
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text padding="8px 0 0"></mj-text>
          <mj-button href="https://estimate.homeinsulationvictoria.com.au/reset-password?token_hash=TEST&amp;type=recovery&amp;next=%2Ffield%2Fwelcome">Set your password</mj-button>
          <mj-text mj-class="small center" padding="0 12px 18px">You'll sign in with sam@example.com. The link works once and lasts 24 hours.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>
      <mj-section>
        <mj-column mj-class="panel">
          <mj-text mj-class="h2" padding="18px 18px 6px">New to how we work?</mj-text>
          <mj-text padding="0 18px 18px">Read the 2-minute guide: Ready Checks, Mitti, your jobs, our leads and getting paid.<br /><a href="https://estimate.homeinsulationvictoria.com.au/field/guide" style="color:#3C51C4;font-weight:700;">Read the guide &rarr;</a></mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>
      <mj-section>
        <mj-column mj-class="panel-amber">
          <mj-text mj-class="h2" padding="18px 18px 6px">No complete form, no payment</mj-text>
          <mj-text padding="0 18px 10px">We pay for the safety check, electrical fixes and installs only when the Mitti form is 100% finished and you've pressed Complete.</mj-text>
          <mj-text padding="0 18px 18px">Every photo and video must be taken in Mitti on site so it's geotagged. If anything is missing, we can't claim the rebate, so we can't pay you until it's fixed.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>
      <mj-section>
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text mj-class="small" padding="14px 12px 0">Questions? Just reply to this email.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-include path="./partials/footer-trade.mjml" />
    </mj-wrapper>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
